@startuml
title Visibility With FUSE Mounted vs Unmounted
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Database namespace" as DB {
  file "report.pdf\nHYDRATED" as R
  file "budget.xlsx\nCLOUD_ONLY" as B
  file "plan.docx\nCLOUD_ONLY" as P
}

folder "Physical sync_dir" as Disk {
  file "report.pdf" as PR
}

rectangle "FUSE mounted at sync_dir" as Mounted {
  file "report.pdf" as MR
  file "budget.xlsx" as MB
  file "plan.docx" as MP
}

rectangle "FUSE absent / client stopped" as Unmounted {
  file "report.pdf only" as UR
}

DB --> Mounted : authoritative namespace
Disk --> Mounted : backing content for HYDRATED item
Disk --> Unmounted : physical content remains directly visible

note bottom of Unmounted
Cloud-only entries are not deleted.
They are simply not locally presentable
without the FUSE layer.
end note
@enduml
